<title>CHINA: BT Fund Managers names VP for business development.</title>
<headline>BT Fund Managers names VP for business development.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Fund Managers Ltd said on Wednesday it has named Viola Tam as vice president for business development.</p>
<p>Tam, who will be responsible for marketing retail funds management services in Asia, was manager for business development before her new appointment, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>BT Fund Managers represents Bankers Trust's international fund management activities in Asia.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
